SET SYSMENU TO
SET SYSMENU AUTOMATIC

DEFINE PAD _46f0hazq0 OF _MSYSMENU PROMPT "Wool White Yarn Opening" COLOR SCHEME 3 ;
	KEY ALT+W, ""
DEFINE PAD _46f0hazq1 OF _MSYSMENU PROMPT "Wool White Yarn Data Entry" COLOR SCHEME 3 ;
	KEY ALT+W, ""
DEFINE PAD _46f0hazq2 OF _MSYSMENU PROMPT "Wool Yarn Report" COLOR SCHEME 3 ;
	KEY ALT+W, ""
DEFINE PAD _46f0hazq3 OF _MSYSMENU PROMPT "Exit" COLOR SCHEME 3 ;
	KEY ALT+E, ""
ON PAD _46f0hazq0 OF _MSYSMENU ACTIVATE POPUP woolwhitey
ON PAD _46f0hazq1 OF _MSYSMENU ACTIVATE POPUP _46e191xty
ON PAD _46f0hazq2 OF _MSYSMENU ACTIVATE POPUP woolyarnre
ON SELECTION PAD _46f0hazq3 OF _MSYSMENU do endprg

DEFINE POPUP woolwhitey MARGIN RELATIVE SHADOW COLOR SCHEME 4
DEFINE BAR 1 OF woolwhitey PROMPT "New Wool Quality Entry"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF woolwhitey PROMPT "Wool Opening Entry"
DEFINE BAR 3 OF woolwhitey PROMPT "White Yarn Opening Entry"
DEFINE BAR 4 OF woolwhitey PROMPT "White Yanr Suplplier Opening"
ON SELECTION BAR 1 OF woolwhitey do form woolqlty
ON SELECTION BAR 2 OF woolwhitey do form woolop
ON SELECTION BAR 3 OF woolwhitey do form Yrnop
ON SELECTION BAR 4 OF woolwhitey do form Yrsupop

DEFINE POPUP _46e191xty MARGIN RELATIVE SHADOW COLOR SCHEME 4
DEFINE BAR 1 OF _46e191xty PROMPT "Raw Wool"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF _46e191xty PROMPT "White Yarn"
ON BAR 1 OF _46e191xty ACTIVATE POPUP newitem
ON BAR 2 OF _46e191xty ACTIVATE POPUP whiteyarn

DEFINE POPUP newitem MARGIN RELATIVE SHADOW COLOR SCHEME 4
DEFINE BAR 1 OF newitem PROMPT "Wool Purchase"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF newitem PROMPT "Wool Issue"
ON SELECTION BAR 1 OF newitem do form woolpu
ON SELECTION BAR 2 OF newitem do form woolissu

DEFINE POPUP whiteyarn MARGIN RELATIVE SHADOW COLOR SCHEME 4
DEFINE BAR 1 OF whiteyarn PROMPT "Yarn Recd Int. Supplier"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF whiteyarn PROMPT "Raw Material Order"
DEFINE BAR 3 OF whiteyarn PROMPT "Raw Material Received"
DEFINE BAR 4 OF whiteyarn PROMPT "Yarn Issue to Dyeing"
ON SELECTION BAR 1 OF whiteyarn do form yrecp
ON SELECTION BAR 2 OF whiteyarn do form yrnorder
ON SELECTION BAR 3 OF whiteyarn do form yrnrecvd
ON SELECTION BAR 4 OF whiteyarn do form yrissdye

DEFINE POPUP woolyarnre MARGIN RELATIVE SHADOW COLOR SCHEME 4
DEFINE BAR 1 OF woolyarnre PROMPT "Wool Report"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF woolyarnre PROMPT "Yarn Report"
